Prerequisites:

1. Make
2. arm compiler tool chain for v7
3. qemu emulator for emulating the binary
4. linux machine to run all these


Clone the repository:
git clone https://github.com/venu8801/ezRTOS.git

Build instructions:
Run the following commands:

make clean

make build_ezRTOS

To run the elf file in qemu use following command:

qemu-system-arm -M stm32vldiscovery -S -gdb tcp::1234 -kernel ezRTOS.elf

using any other terminal connect to multi-arch gdb using the above tcp port ID
add break points and debug the code.


